'''Nimerk of Qym''' (Bacha Nimerk TBD TBD ish Zhifol; born # MONTH {{abbr|2384|1980 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}) is a member of the [[Qymish royal family]]. He is the second son of [[Prince Kytoj of Qym|Prince Kytoj]], [[Bacha XVII of Qym|King Bacha XVII]]'s younger brother, [[Qodzar of Qym|King Qodzar]]'s uncle, as such, is third in the [[line of succession to the Qymish throne]]. He has been serving as the [[Royal Ministry of Finance (Qym)|Royal Minister of Finance]] since {{abbr|2441|2027.8 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, initially appointed by [[Bacha XX of Qym|King Bacha XX]] and retained by his successor, [[Qodzar of Qym|King Qodzar]]. 

In {{abbr|2420|2010 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, he married [[Parna Markaj]], with whom he has two children: [[Princess Danka of Qym|Princess Danka]] and [[Princess Rasanka of Qym|Princess Rasanka]]. 

